00:44:03.990 --> 00:44:04.530
Should have told you.

00:44:06.490 --> 00:44:08.850
Well, there's nothing to worry about, Colonel. You're in good shape.

00:44:09.780 --> 00:44:11.260
You'll be in even better shape when you leave here.

00:44:14.490 --> 00:44:15.890
Tomorrow we'll get down to some real work.

00:45:10.520 --> 00:45:13.580
Beautiful dreamer, wake unto me.

00:45:15.260 --> 00:45:16.980
Starlight and dewdrops.

00:45:25.110 --> 00:45:25.310
